# Tag registry: the one place tags get a display label, a description, or
# aliases. Posts, logs and projects may use any tag; tags not listed here are
# still indexed (shown by their slug). List a tag here when it needs a proper
# label (AI, C++), a description for its /tags page, or when other spellings
# should fold into it (golang -> go). After editing, `npm run generate-tags`.
#
# Slugs are lowercase kebab-case. Every tag written anywhere is normalized the
# same way (lowercased, spaces and punctuation to hyphens) before aliases are
# applied, so "Turkish Cuisine", "turkish cuisine" and "turkish-cuisine" are
# already the same tag without an alias.

(tags)
